#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:4
msgid "How to use a .readthedocs.yaml file in a sub-folder"
msgstr "如何在子目录中使用 .readthedocs.yaml 文件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:6
msgid ""
"This guide shows how to configure a Read the Docs project to use a custom "
"path for the ``.readthedocs.yaml`` build configuration. `Monorepos "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monorepo>`__ that have multiple documentation"
" projects in the same Git repository can benefit from this feature."
msgstr ""
"本指南讲解如何配置 Read the Docs 项目，为 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 构建配置使用自定义路径。同一 Git "
"仓库中有多个文档项目的 `Monorepos <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monorepo>`__ 可从此功能受益。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:9
msgid ""
"By default, Read the Docs will use the ``.readthedocs.yaml`` at the top "
"level of your Git repository. But if a Git repository contains multiple "
"documentation projects that need different build configurations, you will "
"need to have a ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file in multiple sub-folders."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Read the Docs 使用 Git 仓库顶层的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 。但若一个 Git "
"仓库包含多个需要不同构建配置的文档项目，就需要在多个子目录中各放一个 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:16
msgid ""
"`sphinx-multiproject <https://sphinx-"
"multiproject.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`sphinx-multiproject <https://sphinx-"
"multiproject.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you are only using Sphinx projects and want to share the same build "
"configuration, you can also use the ``sphinx-multiproject`` extension."
msgstr "若你只使用 Sphinx 项目且希望共享同一构建配置，也可使用 ``sphinx-multiproject`` 扩展。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`/guides/environment-variables`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/environment-variables`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:21
msgid ""
"You might also be able to reuse the same configuration file across multiple "
"projects, using only environment variables. This is possible if the "
"configuration pattern is very similar and the documentation tool is the "
"same."
msgstr "若配置模式非常相似且文档工具相同，你或许还能仅通过环境变量在多个项目间复用同一配置文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:26
msgid "Implementation considerations"
msgstr "实现注意事项"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:28
msgid ""
"This feature is currently *project-wide*. A custom build configuration file "
"path is applied to all versions of your documentation."
msgstr "此功能目前是*项目级* 的。自定义构建配置文件路径会应用到文档的所有版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:33
msgid ""
"All paths in the ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file are always relative to the "
"**repository root**, regardless of where the configuration file is located."
msgstr "``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件中的所有路径始终相对于**仓库根目录** ，与配置文件所在位置无关。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:36
msgid ""
"For example, if your config file is at ``docs/.readthedocs.yaml`` and your "
"requirements file is at ``docs/requirements.txt``, you should still use "
"``docs/requirements.txt`` as the path in the config file, not "
"``requirements.txt``."
msgstr ""
"例如，若配置文件位于 ``docs/.readthedocs.yaml`` 而 requirements 文件位于 "
"``docs/requirements.txt`` ，配置文件中仍应使用 ``docs/requirements.txt`` 而非 "
"``requirements.txt`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:41
msgid ""
"The one exception is the Sphinx build command itself, which is executed from"
" the directory containing your ``conf.py`` file. This only affects paths "
"that Sphinx resolves internally (for example, inside your ``conf.py``), and "
"does not change how paths in ``.readthedocs.yaml`` are interpreted."
msgstr ""
"唯一的例外是 Sphinx 构建命令本身，它在包含 ``conf.py`` 文件的目录中执行。这只影响 Sphinx 内部解析的路径（例如 "
"``conf.py`` 内部），不改变 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 中路径的解释方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:48
msgid ""
"Changing the configuration path will apply to all versions. Different "
"versions of the project may not be able to build again if this path is "
"changed."
msgstr "更改配置路径会应用到所有版本。若该路径被更改，项目的某些版本可能无法再次构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:52
msgid "Adding an additional project from the same repository"
msgstr "从同一仓库添加其他项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:54
msgid ""
"Once you have added the first project from the :ref:`Import Wizard <intro"
"/add-project:Automatically add your project>`, you will need to repeat this "
"process again to add the additional project from the same repository."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`导入向导 <intro/add-project:Automatically add your project>` "
"添加了第一个项目后，需要重复该流程以从同一仓库添加其他项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:58
msgid "Setting the custom build configuration file"
msgstr "设置自定义构建配置文件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once you have added a Git repository to a project that needs a custom "
"configuration file path, go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings` and "
"add the path to the :guilabel:`Path for .readthedocs.yaml` field."
msgstr ""
"为需要自定义配置文件路径的项目添加 Git 仓库后，前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings` ，在 :guilabel:`Path"
" for .readthedocs.yaml` 字段中填入该路径。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:63
msgid ""
"Screenshot of where to find the :guilabel:`Path for .readthedocs.yaml` "
"setting."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Path for .readthedocs.yaml` 设置位置截图。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:66
msgid ""
"After pressing :guilabel:`Save`, you need to ensure that relevant versions "
"of your documentation are built again."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` 后，需要确保相关版本的文档重新构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:71
msgid ""
"Having multiple different build configuration files can be complex. We "
"recommend setting up 1-2 projects in your Monorepo and getting them to build"
" and publish successfully before adding additional projects to the equation."
msgstr "存在多个不同的构建配置文件可能较为复杂。我们建议先在 Monorepo 中设置 1-2 个项目并确保其成功构建和发布，再加入更多项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:75
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:77
msgid ""
"Once you have your monorepo pattern implemented and tested and it's ready to"
" roll out to all your projects, you should also consider the Read the Docs "
"project setup for these individual projects."
msgstr "monorepo 模式实现并测试通过、可以推广到所有项目后，你还应考虑为这些单独项目配置 Read the Docs 项目设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:80
msgid ""
"Having individual projects gives you the full flexibility of the Read the "
"Docs platform to make individual setups for each project."
msgstr "使用独立项目可让你充分利用 Read the Docs 平台的灵活性，为每个项目做单独配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:82
msgid "For each project, it's now possible to configure:"
msgstr "现在每个项目都可以配置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:84
msgid ""
"Sets of maintainers (or :doc:`organizations </commercial/organizations>` on "
"|com_brand|)"
msgstr "维护者集合（或在 |com_brand| 上使用 :doc:`组织 </commercial/organizations>` ）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:85
msgid ":doc:`Custom redirect rules </guides/custom-domains>`"
msgstr ":doc:`自定义重定向规则 </guides/custom-domains>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:86
msgid ":doc:`Custom domains </guides/custom-domains>`"
msgstr ":doc:`自定义域名 </guides/custom-domains>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:87
msgid ":doc:`Automation rules </automation-rules>`"
msgstr ":doc:`自动化规则 </automation-rules>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:88
msgid ":doc:`Traffic analytics </traffic-analytics>`"
msgstr ":doc:`流量分析 </traffic-analytics>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:89
msgid ""
"Additional documentation tools with individual :doc:`build processes "
"</build-customization>`: One project might use :doc:`Sphinx <sphinx:index>`,"
" while another project setup might use `Asciidoctor "
"<https://asciidoctor.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"带独立 :doc:`构建过程 </build-customization>` 的其他文档工具：一个项目可能使用 :doc:`Sphinx "
"<sphinx:index>` ，而另一个项目可能使用 `Asciidoctor <https://asciidoctor.org/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:93
msgid ""
"...and much more. *All* settings for a Read the Docs project is available "
"for each individual project."
msgstr "……以及更多。Read the Docs 项目的*全部* 设置都可用于每个独立项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:97
msgid ":doc:`/guides/subprojects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/subprojects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:98
msgid ""
"More information on nesting one project inside another project. In this "
"setup, it is still possible to use the same monorepo for each subproject."
msgstr "关于将一个项目嵌套在另一个项目内的更多信息。在这种设置下，每个子项目仍可使用同一个 monorepo。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:102
msgid "Other tips"
msgstr "其他提示"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:104
msgid ""
"For a monorepo, it's not desirable to have changes in unrelated sub-folders "
"trigger new builds."
msgstr "对 monorepo 而言，不相关的子目录发生变化触发新构建并不可取。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/monorepo.rst:107
msgid ""
"Therefore, you should consider setting up :doc:`conditional build "
"cancellation rules </guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds>`. The configuration"
" is added in each ``.readthedocs.yaml``, making it possible to write one "
"conditional build rules per documentation project in the Monorepo 💯️"
msgstr ""
"因此，你应考虑设置 :doc:`条件构建取消规则 </guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds>` 。配置在每个 "
"``.readthedocs.yaml`` 中添加，从而可以为 Monorepo 中的每个文档项目编写一条条件构建规则 💯️"

